        "Description": "Targets: Sheikh Al-Ghazali, Hector Delgado\rGood day. We recently received the request from the client on a particular black market expansion termination. So far the customer has asked us to kill a particular black market drug dealer who&apos;s about to sign up for a regular drug supplement contract with a sheikh of the Middle East. Our client wants to make sure that the killing contract execution will in NO way attract the attention of others and be that blatant to other investigation parties.",
